WEBVTT

1
00:00:00,020 --> 00:00:02,020
What is this human being talking about?

2
00:00:02,520 --> 00:00:06,520
Do you want to hear about the contract that BOSS has not found yet?

3
00:00:06,520 --> 00:00:08,520
OK, OK, you sit down

4
00:00:08,520 --> 00:00:09,520
That's it

5
00:00:09,520 --> 00:00:11,520
a former spy employee

6
00:00:11,520 --> 00:00:13,520
Stole an important contract from BOSS

7
00:00:13,520 --> 00:00:15,520
BOSS found out before the other party left with the contract.

8
00:00:15,520 --> 00:00:17,520
They blocked the entire entrance and exit of the building.

9
00:00:17,520 --> 00:00:19,520
Spy committed suicide by jumping from the 4th floor out of fear

10
00:00:19,520 --> 00:00:21,520
But no contract was found on the body

11
00:00:21,520 --> 00:00:23,520
BOSS inspected the entire building

12
00:00:23,520 --> 00:00:24,520
No contract found

13
00:00:24,520 --> 00:00:26,520
From then on, the contract was different

14
00:00:26,520 --> 00:00:27,520
since then

15
00:00:27,520 --> 00:00:29,520
The 4th floor is blocked because of bad feng shui.

16
00:00:30,020 --> 00:00:32,020
It turns out that you can’t take the elevator to the 4th floor.

17
00:00:32,020 --> 00:00:34,020
The fourth floor is closed because it affects Feng Shui.

18
00:00:34,020 --> 00:00:36,020
Has BOSS been looking for the 4th floor?

19
00:00:36,020 --> 00:00:37,020
Lily went out to look for her once

20
00:00:37,020 --> 00:00:39,020
If I didn’t find it, I didn’t look for it again.

21
00:00:39,020 --> 00:00:40,020
How long ago was this?

22
00:00:40,020 --> 00:00:42,020
Is that contract still important now?

23
00:00:42,020 --> 00:00:43,020
Why do you ask that?

24
00:00:43,020 --> 00:00:44,020
Of course it's important

25
00:00:44,020 --> 00:00:46,020
Since it is important to BOSS

26
00:00:46,020 --> 00:00:47,020
Then if I find it

27
00:00:47,020 --> 00:00:48,020
It can be corrected

28
00:00:48,020 --> 00:00:50,020
But this contract is definitely not hidden in a formal place.

29
00:00:50,020 --> 00:00:53,020
Otherwise, how could so many people not find it?

30
00:00:53,020 --> 00:00:55,020
I’ll go check it out on the 4th floor after get off work tomorrow.
